[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.93]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.55]I never got their name until the credits
[00:14.97]now it plays here every single day
[00:18.02]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:23.00]One note at a time
[00:26.78]from people passing through
[00:31.88]a name beside a line
[00:35.50]and part of it is you
[00:41.16]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
